---
Title: Fruity Pebbles Rice Krispy Treats
Servings: 12 servings
Tags: Munchies, Homemade
---

Spread @Butter{} into #9x13 pan{} (so treats won't stick)

Melt @Butter{1/4 cup} in a #large pot{}.

Turn burner off, melt @Marshmellows{1 package} into the butter, stirring constantly.

Add @Rice Krispies{3 cups} & @Fruity Pebbles{3 cups} into the melted marshmellow mixture, stirring until well coated.

Place in pan
